 We consider the zigzag triangulation $T_0$ of $P$, where the long diagonal is replaced by the four tangents as illustrated in \cref{fig:typeDConstructionC}. Let $T_i$ be obtained from $T_0$ by a rotation of angle $\nicefrac{i\pi}{n}$. Note that together $T_0, \dots, T_{n-1}$ cover all chords.
