  Suppose that a natural transformation $\lambda\colon \powfunc \Rightarrow \mathcal{D}$ exists.
  Since $\mathcal{D}$ is a subfunctor of $\erealfunc$, 
  \cref{lem:subfunctor} and \cref{thm:monoid_lambda}.\ref{item:case_cycle} imply that
  % Composing $\lambda$ with the inclusion $\mathcal{D} \hookrightarrow F_{([0, 1], +, 0)}$ yields
