\section{LLM evaluation prompt}
\label{appendix:llm_prompt}

The following prompt was used to instruct Google's Gemini 2.5 Flash model to evaluate and rank the search results from LeanExplore, LeanSearch, and Moogle. The placeholders \code{Engine A}, \code{Engine B}, and \code{Engine C} were randomly assigned to the three search engines for each query to mitigate bias. The \code{\{Query\}} and \code{\{Formatted Results for Engine X\}} placeholders were populated with the specific query and the top 5 formatted results from the respective engine.

