\subsection{Visual Understanding}


We evaluate the visual understanding capabilities of Stream-Omni in Table~\ref{tab:vision_eval}. Compared to advanced vision-oriented LMMs and VITA-1.5 \citep{fu2025vita15gpt4olevelrealtime}, Stream-Omni demonstrates strong visual capabilities on various visual tasks.
More importantly, despite being a unified model that simultaneously supports vision, speech, and text, Stream-Omni achieves performance comparable to vision-oriented LMMs, indicating its effectiveness in mitigating modality interference.

