\subsection{Real-Time Safety Tests} \label{sec:results-radsan}
The real-time safety tests demonstrate a persistent pattern of real-time violations across all inference engines, neural network models, and inference counts. However, the frequency of these violations varies, as illustrated in Fig. \ref{fig:RadSan}.
