  \caption{A Halin graph illustrating a possible selection of vertices $r$, $v$ and $w$. Solid edges represent the skeleton, while dashed edges form the leaf cycle. The $x$-values corresponding to Proposition~\ref{TEO:ORDEN} are displayed within each vertex}
