Closely related to our work, \cite{mueggler2018continuous} fuses asynchronous event camera data with IMU in a CT SLAM, effectively handling high-rate measurements for dynamic platforms. Additionally, CT SLAM frameworks like \cite{lv2023continuous} support multi-sensor fusion (LiDAR, camera, IMU) with online time-offset estimation, demonstrating CT’s flexibility in handling complex sensor fusion tasks.

