\subsubsection{Comparisons}
To further validate our proposed method, we compare it with existing methods in Table.\ref{tab:comparison}, such as pure-IMU, River\cite{chen2024river}, CMax-SLAM\cite{guo2024cmax}, RIO\cite{DoerJGN2022}, EIO\cite{xiao2022research}, Ultimate-SLAM\cite{Rosinol_2018_RAL}. 
We used absolute and relative velocity errors(abbr. AVE, RVE) and absolute and relative pose errors(abbr. APE, RPE), to accurately and comprehensively evaluate the performance of each velocity estimation algorithm. 
