    The procedure $\Reduce_{n,k}$ (Algorithm~\ref{alg:reducebasis} and Algorithm~\ref{alg:reduce}) can be implemented in symmetric linear ${\mathbb Z}_2$-Datalog using at most $(4(k-1) + 3)$-many stages. 
\end{proposition}
\begin{proof}
%For Algorithm~\ref{alg:reducebasis}, we use that Solve$_{n,1}$ is in symmetric linear ${\mathbb Z}_2$-Datalog of stage one; is is then straightforward to implement remaining steps of the algorithm in (recursion-free) symmetric linear Datalog.

